 Zoe Saldaña has become one of Paramount+'s biggest stars thanks to Lioness . Taylor Sheridan's action-packed CIA thriller gave the Oscar winner one of her most demanding TV roles yet. Saldaña spent three seasons playing Joe McNamara, a character who commands a dangerous operation without blinking, yet struggles to keep her personal life from falling apart.
