 Taylor Sheridan is juggling a lot, and his complex professional commitments could also affect the timeline. His major NBCUniversal deal includes a film agreement beginning in 2026, while his television commitments to Paramount continue through 2028. While Lioness isn't automatically affected by the deal, his growing slate of projects could slow things down.
 While Aaliyah's revenge and Joe's broken family remain unresolved, Positano is a great new chapter for Zoe Saldaña.
